    "tradeoffs": [
      "Exports hold an exclusive workspace source lock during validation and publication; ordinary source writers share that lock and remain concurrent outside an export. Same-workspace export concurrency is traded for withdrawal consistency.",
      "The sample authoring API holds selected asset bytes in memory; streaming large datasets is not claimed."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Synthetic sources and scripted pose/trainer fixtures only; no real COLMAP reconstruction, CUDA gsplat training, or vision-model run was executed.",
      "No real photograph was sent to a hosted model.",
      "Account-holder attestations do not establish independent subject authentication or licensor authority.",
      "Offline verification establishes export-time signed state; later revocations require a current ledger and cannot retract downloaded copies or reverse prior model training.",
      "FR-11 demand evidence from two prospective licensees is outstanding; Phase 7B remains a design.",
      "Retained logs replace local absolute paths; raw run logs remain in the task temporary directory."
    ],
